      "writtenOn": "2022-07-20T16:27:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Along with AC removal, this specific condition for low battery level check is relevant for power boss policy handling. If power boss policy is added for low battery condition, it helps in  preventing immediate shutdown due to battery brown out condition. The other places, where host event is send for low battery indication doesn\u0027t handle any power boss policy (ie, increase pd seq num, proc hot action etc).",
      "parentUuid": "ef594f9e_38c11c7f",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 101,
        "startChar": 2,
        "endLine": 101,
