      "message": "I thought of using this as throttle reason, because here prochot is send during AC removal or in low battery condition, which means battery is in  discharging condition. So, i just reused one of this.\nAt present, we have these 4 conditions:\n        THROTTLE_SRC_THERMAL \u003d 0,\n        THROTTLE_SRC_BAT_DISCHG_CURRENT,\n        THROTTLE_SRC_BAT_VOLTAGE,\n        THROTTLE_SRC_AC,\n\n  But , yea..not evaluating any discharging current! 😊  which one sounds as a better reasoning to add? THROTTLE_SRC_BAT_DISCHG  or THROTTLE_SRC_DTT or THROTTLE_SRC_DTT_POWERBOSS_ACTION ?",
